# Rose Arch Villa
# Source: King's Quest VI (VGA) - reference/kq6/r03-c08.png; reframed with:
#   pnpm grid reference/kq6/r03-c08.png --name kq6-r03-c08
# Method: translated by eye. Kept: the salmon villa with its three shuttered windows, porch,
#   dark doorway, steps and creeping vines; the rose arbour; the rose hedge on its low wall;
#   the two palms on the left; the dark trees and distant hill; the lawns; the big sunlit dirt
#   path with its shadows; two boulders and the dark agave in the foreground.
#   Dropped: individual roses and leaves, pebbles, the cream haze patch behind the trees,
#   the sun glare on the villa's top corner, the small window on the right wing.
# Colours: pale sky → blue, hazy hill → lightblue, dark trees → green with black shadows,
#   salmon plaster → lightred with red shading, shutters → brown, stone steps and path →
#   lightgrey/darkgrey, lawns → lightgreen with green shade, sunlit dirt → yellow with brown
#   shadows, rose hedge → green with lightred/red roses, low walls → red, agave → black.
scene "Rose Arch Villa"
variants day

